Install short alias symlinks (sjq, syq, sxq, sjq-locate, syq-locate, sxq-locate)

Usage: succinctly install-aliases [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --dir <DIR>  Directory to create symlinks in (default: same directory as the binary)
  -h, --help       Print help
